<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak Jan-Oct trade deficit widens to SKK 42.5bln.</title>
<headline>Slovak Jan-Oct trade deficit widens to SKK 42.5bln.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak trade deficit for the first 10 months of the year widened to 42.52 billion crowns, from a deficit of 37.17 billion crowns for the January- September period, the Slovak Statistical Bureau (SUSR) said on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
